<title>FRANCE: Air Portugal orders 18 Airbus A319 jets.</title>
<headline>Air Portugal orders 18 Airbus A319 jets.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1996-10-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Airbus Industrie said on Tuesday that TAP-Air Portugal decided to acquire 18 single aisle A319s from Airbus Industrie as part of its medium-range fleet renewal plan.</p>
<p>Five of these aircraft can be converted into A320s.</p>
<p>The company has also taken an option on eight aircraft from Airbus's single aisle family and will lease another four A319s, Airbus said in a statement.</p>
</text>
